{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resume","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"resume","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack(im)resume","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resume","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Resumes downloading if the pack is inactive.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resume","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a pack resumes after being suspended, it may begin by iterating over the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already downloaded resources. As a result, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" structure’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"countOfResourcesCompleted"},{"type":"text","text":" field may revert to 0 before rapidly returning to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the level of progress at the time the pack was suspended."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To temporarily suspend downloading, call the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-suspend"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/resume"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack\/resume"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProjec